{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05120","headline":"送韦商州弼 · 沈佺期","name":"送韦商州弼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"会府应文昌，商山镇国阳。\n闻君监郡史，蹔罢尚书郎。\n王事嗟相失，人情贵不忘。\n累年同画省，四海接文场。\n点翰芳春色，传杯明月光。\n故交从此去，遥忆紫芝香。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05120.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05120","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}